.DS_Store

# macOS writes a metadata file literally called `Icon\r`, and the usual global
# rule for it is `Icon?`. On a case-insensitive filesystem that also matches the
# directory `icons`, so every app icon in this repository is ignored by default
# and a new one is silently never committed — which is only discovered by a
# release failing on a file it was told to bundle.
#
# The 54 icons already here were added before that rule existed on this machine.
!/src-tauri/icons/
